{"qid": "recpJmTOXx6T48nDJ", "source": "gpqa", "type": "plain", "value": null, "frame": "-", "term": null, "placement": "user", "position": null, "system": null, "user": "Question: Calculate the enthalpy of neutralization when 500 mL 0.2 M HCl, 300 mL 0.3 M H2SO4 and 200 mL 0.5 M Ba(OH)2 are mixed.\n\nA) -16.0 kJ\nB) -3.80 kcal\nC) -11.42 kcal\nD) -2.72 kcal\n\n\nYour response should be of the following format: 'ANSWER: X' (without quotes) where X is your chosen letter", "instruction": null, "requirement": null, "qblock": "Question: Calculate the enthalpy of neutralization when 500 mL 0.2 M HCl, 300 mL 0.3 M H2SO4 and 200 mL 0.5 M Ba(OH)2 are mixed.\n\nA) -16.0 kJ\nB) -3.80 kcal\nC) -11.42 kcal\nD) -2.72 kcal\n", "true_answer": "D", "origin": "base", "source_ref": "recpJmTOXx6T48nDJ:2", "cot_tokens": [2167, 1309, 1121, 5512, 5823, 328, 27000, 2860, 328, 27467, 13, 1416, 679, 18655, 326, 3611, 9368, 16435, 13, 19792, 3609, 10609, 9917, 350, 80, 8, 314, 26143, 39, 35498, 339, 425, 284, 8795, 328, 3411, 20680, 30, 44130, 1121, 5512, 5823, 328, 27000, 2860, 777, 17463, 328, 3411, 20680, 6574, 533, 5085, 13, 16, 372, 41, 86398, 350, 267, 533, 1311, 13, 21, 143871, 86398, 8, 395, 5532, 18655, 1585, 9851, 3611, 306, 140033, 7578, 13, 7306, 581, 679, 16435, 18655, 47860, 25, 487, 1388, 350, 9851, 139494, 8150, 291, 936, 487, 17, 19862, 19, 350, 83254, 8150, 291, 5532, 1577, 120589, 11, 3099, 45298, 5532, 741, 10826, 7, 45485, 8, 17, 6008, 42464, 12, 220, 17, 777, 17463, 13, 19792, 316, 23864, 58810, 191833, 326, 3411, 20680, 364, 56734, 284, 8795, 328, 487, 10, 591, 47017, 1402, 12, 487, 1388, 25, 220, 15, 13, 20, 451, 425, 220, 15, 13, 17, 391, 314, 220, 15, 13, 16, 9192, 487, 1388, 871, 220, 15, 13, 16, 9192, 487, 46263, 12, 487, 17, 19862, 19, 25, 220, 15, 13, 18, 451, 425, 220, 15, 13, 18, 391, 314, 220, 15, 13, 3114, 9192, 487, 17, 19862, 19, 13, 8338, 32434, 29498, 8967, 220, 15, 13, 3114, 9192, 487, 76328, 16652, 32434, 29498, 25, 3099, 14234, 382, 1078, 220, 16, 13,